      "content": "therapy just feels like another way to try and \"fix\" something that isn't even broken, it's just how i am. it's just more effort. i'm just so tired of the constant struggle. sometimes i look at the world and i just think... wouldn't it be so much easier if everything just stopped? like, if there was just nothingness. just to finally have some actual peace from all this noise.",
